Z||000031||Songman||07-23-2001||11:47 AM||||Personally, I don't care what these people drive. If someone wants to put that crap all over their cars and think it makes their cars A) look good; B) impress people: or C) become an exotic sports car.. that is their business.<P>As for me, I will just shake my head in wonder and laugh at them with the rest of the world. And just think to myself "Where is a F'ing cop? I wish these idiots would turn down those stereos they are so proud of because I don't want or need to hear their bass-blasting jungle rhythms in my car over my own Merle Haggard CD."<P>What I think is REALLY stupid is to come here an create a new member just to start this crap! I can guarantee you that most of us here don't give a &^$& about your car or car club, but now you have pissed a lot of us off. And I am sure by your skin head, backward hat attitude that you don't really care about that either. So what was the point in the first place..<P>So I'll just politely say goodbye to you and ignore any future posts from you....<P>Goodbye.<P>OH! btw.. after reading all of this rant I had to go over and check out the page... They were right. That is some ugly ass cars! hehe... <P>'Just another Tennessee Cow Tipper' Come on down and let me and My7 take you to lunch sometime!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 07-23-2001).]||||reg||1
