Z||000045||Mach10||07-24-2001||01:45 PM||||Now it's getting nasty. EVeryone just relax.<BR>Someone started a post about a humorous car (or two). We made some pretty funny comments. The owner shows up and responds with some equally funny comments... What's the problem here? I can live with making fun of an ugly ass car (with 13" playa rimz   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) just as I can live with taking the ****  back. If you're gonna sling bull, be prepared to have it chucked back. <BR>Personally, I think this JDOGG1 guy's all right. Just misguided and colorblind   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Stop drilling the guy on a personal level...<P>edit:<BR>BTW, you CAN put a stereo in a Fiero:<BR>DEHP-430 Head<BR>5'1/4 Premier 3-way Coaxs up front<BR>4" Rockford FanaticQ Mids in the back<BR>Rockford Power 150a<sup>1</sup> driving a single sealed 10" Kicker C-10<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 07-24-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000046||frontal lobe||07-24-2001||02:49 PM||||KnightRyder31, he didn't come here and start it, Tweek did with his post. (Which I have no objection to--I thought it was humorous).  I have no problem with JDogg1 responding, either.  I thought his response was funny, too.<P>Galen, here's a principal of life you might want to consider:  Just because a certain thought occurs to you doesn't mean you HAVE to say it (or type it in this case).  Yes, you are entitled to your opinion, you have rights, blah, blah, blah.  I'm just saying you don't HAVE to make them known every time, especially when you might consider how insulted someone might be from them.<P>JDogg1, I would make a fair guess that your and my tastes differ GREATLY, but welcome to the forum anyway.  It will be fun to know if 5 or 10 years from now, your tastes will change, like many of us have had time to do over the years.  But if it doesn't, fine with me.  You are still welcome as far as I'm concerned.||||reg||1
