Z||000060||FieroKyle||07-26-2001||03:25 PM||||I just saw pics of this Shadow. HAHAHAHAHA. Cheap ass speakers, cheap ass deck, cheap ass paint job. So with those rims his speedo probably says he is doin 100 when he is going 60. Yup, no end to the ricer. Looks like he tried though. He gets a gold star for that. What speaker competitions, against the neighborhood block? I will tell you something, I found it hard to compete anymore when I found out you can buy trophies. Haha, lmao. Anyways you will see my tail lights if we meet. HAHAHAHAHA. Then you have like all this angered stored up in you to even post this message. HAHAHAHAHA. Very typical ricer move, more to his mouth than what he really has. You define rice perfectly. HAppy tunes, later. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign_1.jpg">  <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>AOL Name: Yakty Yak<BR>E-Mail: YaktyYak@aol.com<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||1
