Z||000062||Steve Normington||07-26-2001||05:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroKyle:<BR><B>So with those rims his speedo probably says he is doin 100 when he is going 60. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's why ricers always claim their car is so fast, they are using incorrect readings. They race until their tripometer shows 2 more tenths of a mile plus a half tick and figure that as their 1/4 mile time. Then they read the speedo at that point for the end speed at the 1/4 mile.<P>So... If I replace my 195/70 R15 tires with 195/40 R 12 tires, I can get my 1/4 mile from 15 seconds to 10 seconds! Off to the wheel store.||||reg||1
Z||000063||JDOGG1||07-26-2001||05:56 PM||||Hey, I thought we came to an agreement that my car wasn't a POS...It has just got a personality complex, thats all!! Sorry if people still think I have a cheap (trophy winning) stereo.Yeah check the site again...<BR>I can't afford all the fancy ****  while I'm working at my current job,besides. I can't just have mommy and daddy go out and buy my equipment. I really wish you some people would show "some" appreciation to what work I have been able to put into the Shadow since I barely make enough for insurance itself. Until next post, I guess I will keep doin' what I'm doin', I know some people on this site are starting to appreciate it a little. Thanks for the input.<BR>( P.S..If this post sounds really sarcastic, it is not supposed to. I am just saying what I think.)||||reg||7
