Z||000072||Songman||07-28-2001||10:32 AM||||You know... I keep hoping this will die...<P>The kid admitted he made a mistake by slamming people and he has apologized for it several times. But everyone keeps coming in here and jumping on the bandwagon of saying his car is a POS. What must he do now to get you people to leave him alone? Does he have to sell his Shadow and buy A Fiero to stop the slamming? This is not what we are about here. People laugh at our cars too! I know, I used to be one that did! Until I got a Fiero I thought that my 911s and Jags were the only cars in the world worth having!<P>People say they want our 'close knit' family back here but continue to slam people who think differently than they do. The kid obviously likes his car. He has put together the best stereo he can afford. And he has got together a group of his friends that enjoy the same. AND HE HAS APOLOGIZED REPEATEDLY FOR THE WAY HE ENTERED HERE!<P>He is not the one keeping this going. It's as simple as that. If you want to point fingers, go do it in front of a mirror.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 07-28-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000073||Tweek||07-28-2001||12:17 PM||||Wanted to say a few things...<P>1. My internet service was disconnected a few days ago, so I won't be on here much, and thats why I haven't for the past few.<P>2. I don't have the time to read all the posts in this thread at the moment, but I will eventually.<P>Most Important:<P>3. There are things that we all do every day that would would be considered wrong by some people ethically, but not legaly.  I have been thinking about what I said about jdogg's car, and although I dont personally like the style, I believe that publically making fun of it was wrong, (that you jdogg for making me think) and I would like to make a public apolgy to him for it. In the future I will try my best not to overly judge someone else's taste because I don't agree..<P>So I will see you all sometime later, I will try to be on now and again till my cable's hooked back up.<P><BR>peace.||||reg||14
